       title="Dorkag" id="Dorkag">

    <p>
        DORKAG builds JetBrains IDE plugins that keep you in the editor:
        <a href="Azd.topic">AZD</a>, <a href="GBrowser.topic">GBrowser</a>,
        <a href="JirAI.topic">JirAI</a>, <a href="Codecov.topic">Codecov</a>, and
        <a href="QueryFlag.topic">QueryFlag</a>.
    </p>
    <p>
        Pick a plugin below for installation, configuration, and feature documentation.
    </p>
    <list columns="5" type="none">
        <li>
            <list type="none">
                <li><a href="Azd.topic" summary="Manage Azure DevOps projects from your JetBrains IDE">
                    <img src="azd_icon.svg" alt="azd_icon"/>
                </a></li>
                <li>
                    <a href="Azd.topic">
                        <ui-path>AZD</ui-path>
                    </a>
                </li>
                <li>Clone repositories, review pull requests, and manage pipelines in Azure DevOps.</li>
            </list>
        </li>
        <li>
            <list type="none">
                <li><a href="GBrowser.topic" summary="An embedded web browser window within your IDE">
                    <img src="gbrowser_icon.png" alt="gbrowser_icon"/>
                </a></li>

                <li>
                    <a href="GBrowser.topic">
                        <ui-path>GBrowser</ui-path>
                    </a>
                </li>
                <li>An embedded web browser window inside your IDE, with no context switch.</li>
            </list>
        </li>
        <li>
            <list type="none">
                <li><a href="JirAI.topic" summary="The full Jira Cloud experience without leaving your IDE">
                    <img src="jirai_icon.svg" alt="jirai_icon"/>
                </a></li>
                <li>
                    <a href="JirAI.topic">
                        <ui-path>JirAI</ui-path>
                    </a>
                </li>
                <li>Browse, filter, and edit Jira Cloud issues, with AI-assisted issue creation.</li>
            </list>
        </li>
        <li>
            <list type="none">
                <li><a href="Codecov.topic" summary="Bring Codecov insights directly into your IDE">
                    <img src="code_cov.svg" alt="code_cov"/>
                </a></li>
                <li>
                    <a href="Codecov.topic">
                        <ui-path>Codecov</ui-path>
                    </a>
                </li>
                <li>Line-by-line coverage, PR impact, and project health in your editor.</li>
            </list>
        </li>
        <li>
            <list type="none">
                <li><a href="QueryFlag.topic" summary="Define and execute template-based queries on selected text">
                    <img src="queryflag.svg" alt="queryflag"/>
                </a></li>
                <li>
                    <a href="QueryFlag.topic">
                        <ui-path>QueryFlag</ui-path>
                    </a>
                </li>
                <li>Define and run template-based queries on selected text, straight from the editor.</li>
            </list>
        </li>
    </list>

    <p>
        Built by Jonathan Gafner, a software engineer with 14+ years in the industry,
        in his free time.
